# Rust build artifacts
target/

# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed. FerroCP ships binaries and wheels, so
# the lock file is what makes builds reproducible and makes the cargo deny /
# cargo audit gates meaningful. Do not add it back here.

# Wheel build artifacts
wheelhouse/

